{"5132030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drain the Galaxy", "steam_appid": 5132030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/0c7cd6b58d67eedb8d067071d5e374b6.poster.avif?t=1788333647\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/0c7cd6b58d67eedb8d067071d5e374b6.webm?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/0c7cd6b58d67eedb8d067071d5e374b6.mp4?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drain the Galaxy with a Thousand Dwarves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a galactic dwarf starship. Your crew touches down on a planet, bites into the rock, and won't pack up until the cargo bay is bursting. No rush, no pressure - just sit back and watch your army and your bank account grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/fd3d7ab5a8e2a9b86e36106610aa5610.poster.avif?t=1788333647\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/fd3d7ab5a8e2a9b86e36106610aa5610.webm?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/fd3d7ab5a8e2a9b86e36106610aa5610.mp4?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How It Works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship touches down, the drill punches through the crust, and out pours a tide of dwarves. They swarm exposed rock, rip out the ore, and haul it back to the hold on their own. Meanwhile you grab the pickaxe for combo multipliers, slice rock with a laser, or call down a missile strike - all while thousands of little miners do the heavy lifting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands of Dwarves &amp; 3 Classes</strong>: Miners, Demolishers, and Snipers - each with a clear job underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ore Veins</strong>: Hidden pockets buried in the rock. Spot them, surround them, and break them open for a fat instant payout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Cores</strong>: Gold, silver, or diamond cores tucked away beneath the crust - crack one open for a massive haul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Tools</strong>: Pickaxe combos stack up to 8x, a laser cutter that chews through anything, and the &quot;Dragonfly&quot; missile launcher with its own upgrade tree and critical hits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Modifiers</strong>: Each session rolls new conditions - fragile rock that shatters easy, magnetic storms that scramble your gear, or pure gold planets worth a fortune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Exploration</strong>: Chase down rare planets, dig up ancient artifacts, and unlock lasting buffs for your next expansion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clan Leaderboards</strong>: Hoard gold and climb the ranks of the galaxy's greediest dwarf clans.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Rush </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drain the Galaxy</strong> is a chill incremental game. There are no clever tactics to learn and no progress to lose. Switch it on, watch the numbers tick up, and strip-mine the galaxy at whatever pace feels</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/0c7cd6b58d67eedb8d067071d5e374b6.poster.avif?t=1788333647\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/0c7cd6b58d67eedb8d067071d5e374b6.webm?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/0c7cd6b58d67eedb8d067071d5e374b6.mp4?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drain the Galaxy with a Thousand Dwarves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a galactic dwarf starship. Your crew touches down on a planet, bites into the rock, and won't pack up until the cargo bay is bursting. No rush, no pressure - just sit back and watch your army and your bank account grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/fd3d7ab5a8e2a9b86e36106610aa5610.poster.avif?t=1788333647\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/fd3d7ab5a8e2a9b86e36106610aa5610.webm?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132030/extras/fd3d7ab5a8e2a9b86e36106610aa5610.mp4?t=1788333647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How It Works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship touches down, the drill punches through the crust, and out pours a tide of dwarves. They swarm exposed rock, rip out the ore, and haul it back to the hold on their own. Meanwhile you grab the pickaxe for combo multipliers, slice rock with a laser, or call down a missile strike - all while thousands of little miners do the heavy lifting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><u